WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.002 --> 00:00:06.911
Portrait Dock keeps the everyday tools in two rows. Insert
image stays right next to Select and Pan.

2
00:00:07.412 --> 00:00:10.823
Choose Rectangle to draw a box without opening another
panel.

3
00:00:11.323 --> 00:00:17.710
For an ellipse, open More tools. The dock names Ellipse
while it's active, even after the panel closes.

4
00:00:18.211 --> 00:00:21.968
Now draw the ellipse. The image button is still in the same
spot.
